# Regenerable cache and generated output. content/ is the source of truth;
# everything below is rebuilt by scripts/{fetch,match,build-data}.ts and is
# disposable by design.
#
# Note content/tmdb-seed/ and content/tmdb-episodes/ are deliberately NOT here.
# The first covers series with no real TMDB id, so nothing can re-fetch them.
# The second holds the fetched episode lists, and without them a clone with no
# TMDB credential would build an archive with no episodes at all — committing
# them is what makes the keyless path a real fallback rather than an empty
# site. See the README in each directory.
data/tmdb/
data/youtube/
public/data/
